You’re the legend in the comments, the whisperer of the socials;
You’re a chameleon when it comes to shifting between brand tone of voices and -vibes;
You’re the reason our followers are smiling;
You’re the one with your finger on the pulse of the online world, always in the loop with the latest trends and buzz;
Comments that land on your plate are usually cheer but sometimes jeer. So you're basically on the social frontlines, deciding whether a pinch of humor will de-escalate or if it's time to call the PR department.

Minimum HBO work and thinking level;
You are always online and up to date with the latest (social media)trends;
You are creative and customer-oriented when solving problems;
You are available to work during weekdays, evenings and weekends;
You have an excellent command of the Dutch language and English.
